/**
 * CONTROL THEORY.
 *
 * The CONTROL track: the subject that turns a mechanism into a machine that
 * does what you asked. Everything here is computable and testable on a real
 * motor with an encoder, which is deliberate - control theory learned only
 * symbolically does not survive contact with friction, deadband and noise.
 *
 * Order: feedback -> PID terms -> implementation -> tuning -> stability ->
 * state space -> trajectories -> motor control cascades.
 */
