          'Output clamp: 0 to 12 V equivalent, or -255 to 255 in PWM units if bidirectional',
          'Anti-windup: clamp the integral so that Ki*integral can never exceed the output range on its own, and stop integrating when the output is saturated and the error has the same sign as the output',
